direction_554 = location "Troll" about "Troll\n Monsters who led the Army of Darkness in the war between humans and Pathos; Defense Power and Immunity are not high but they possess high Attack Power and HP" found "El Morad" elmorad at 604 1524 in zone 2
direction_555 = location "Troll" about "Troll\n Monsters who led the Army of Darkness in the war between humans and Pathos; Defense Power and Immunity are not high but they possess high Attack Power and HP" found "Karus" karus at 1290 350 in zone 1

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "[Whoever wants to, erm, 'share the glory', come to the Waste Land!]"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "- Offical Notice -\n\nI have killed millions of monsters, and I've never been afraid for my life. But! Those Trolls were a real pants-filler. I nearly died several times fighting them, but next time they won't be so lucky. That's because I'm going to go back there and rip them some new ones! Anyone else who wants a piece, come and meet me at the Waste Land!!"
    If player is elmorad
        Say "[Who want to enjoy the glory together come to the Revival Hole!!]"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "- Offical Notice -\n\nI have killed millions of monsters, and I've never been afraid for my life. But! Those Trolls were a real bed-wetter. I nearly died several times fighting them, but next time they won't be so lucky. That's because I'm going to go back there and rip them some new ones! Anyone else who wants a piece, come and meet me at the Revival Hole!!"

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "(Monologue) Must get to the Waste Land..."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_555
    If player is elmorad
        Say "(Monologue) Must go to the Revival Hole..."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_554

On ready
    Say "Well, the Trolls were just as tough as advertised. But, errr~ Master, you killed them all! Ha Ha Ha!"
    Topic "Confirm" goto close
